{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>For they are enemies to you.</b> From here they said: if he comes to kill you, rise early to kill him. בנכליהם אשר נכלו לכם — through their schemes with which they schemed against you concerning the matter of Pe'or, that they plotted to make you sin, and from them you have cause to take vengeance — and not from Pinehas." "<b>Concerning the matter of Cozbi daughter of a Midianite prince, their sister.</b> And is she their sister? Was she not the daughter of a different tribe? Rather, since she gave her life for her tribe, the tribe is called by her name — <b>אחתם</b>, their sister."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:43.994338883Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}